// app/js/voice-clips.js: the 51 spoken words for the cell + time announcement and spelling the name (one voice, mono MP3), built in so the app stays offline.
// Part of Grid Player, loaded by Grid-v5.html with a plain <script> (no modules, so it also works opened from disk).
// A-Z = the letters (A-T are also the columns), 0-20 = the number words ("zero" ... "twenty"), point = "point", target = "target cell", time = "time", name = "name bubble" (before a spelled name). Made once with the Kokoro voice "af_heart", then sped up (ffmpeg atempo=1.14: same pitch) so it plays 10% faster.
// A and F are made from their exact sounds (eɪ, ɛf): spelled "ay" / "eff" the voice said "eye" and "E-F-F".
// Embedded as data: URIs because a page opened from disk (file://) is not allowed to fetch() files next to it.
